WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:03.000
[A dry block-clock tick. A soft heartbeat pulses.]

00:03.000 --> 00:05.400
[A slow, quiet synth pad breathes in C minor.]

00:05.400 --> 00:07.500
[On a rooftop, a raccoon chirps — two warbly notes.]

00:07.500 --> 00:12.500
[The raccoon dissolves into drifting copper embers.]

00:12.500 --> 00:16.500
[The embers reform as a lantern. The same chirp returns, now quantized.]

00:16.500 --> 00:20.400
[Seven street lamps ignite one after another, each a soft zap-spark.]

00:20.400 --> 00:21.000
[A final block-clock tick.]
